section
  height: fill
  valign: bottom
  text "Go layouts are available only when explicitly tagged go:\"…\", because in Go's reference-time language the string `Q1 2006 review` renders as `Q8 2026 review` — the 1 is the month. strftime is the default for exactly that reason: every directive starts with %, so literal text stays literal."
    font-size: 6.5pt
    color: gray(0.5)
